# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/

# Generated by Tauri
# will have schema files for capabilities auto-completion
/gen/schemas

# Updater signing keypair (from `tauri signer generate`) — the private key
# must never commit, same care as the Android release keystore (see
# android/RELEASE_SIGNING.md). The .pub file isn't secret (its contents are
# already pasted into tauri.conf.json's plugins.updater.pubkey) but is left
# untracked too since it's just a local build artifact once that's done.
*.key
*.key.pub
